sequenceDiagram
    participant CM as ContainerManager
    participant DR as DockerRuntime
    participant FSM as FSM
    
    CM->>CM: transition(inst, Creating)
    CM->>DR: Start(container)
    DR->>DR: ContainerStart() ✓
    DR->>CM: emitEvent("ContainerStarted")
    Note over CM: ⚠️ 若此事件未被正确处理...
    DR->>DR: Monitor() → waitContainerExit()
    Note over DR: bwa index 脚本很快退出
    DR->>CM: emitEvent("ContainerExited")
    CM->>FSM: transition(Creating → Stopped)
    FSM-->>CM: ❌ INVALID! (原只允许 Creating→Running/Failed)
    Note over CM: 静默吞掉错误，容器永久卡在 creating